<div class="columns">
  <div class="first-column">
    <div class="image-and-label">
      <div class="image-wrapper">
        <img src='/images/task-workflow.svg'>
      </div>
      <p class="image-label">Task Workflow Diagram</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="second-column">
    <p>Tasks have seven status options:</p>
    <dl>
      <dt id="task-status-unasigned" class="color-green">Unassigned</dt>
      <dd>
        Tasks can be opened to address a specific issue or independently
      </dd>

      <dt id="task-status-assigned" class="color-blue">Assigned</dt>
      <dd>One or more users were assigned to perform work</dd>

      <dt id="task-status-in-progress" class="color-yellow">In Progress</dt>
      <dd>An assigned user has started progress</dd>

      <dt id="task-status-in-review" class="color-purple">In Review</dt>
      <dd>An assigned user has put the Task up for review</dd>

      <dt id="task-status-approved" class="color-red">Approved</dt>
      <dd>
        Task approved by a reviewer which closes it. If an Issue is connected, it is also
        closed and has it's status set to
        <a href="/workflows#issue-status-addressed">Addressed</a>
      </dd>

      <dt id="task-status-duplicate" class="color-red">Duplicate</dt>
      <dd>Closed because it's a duplicate of another</dd>

      <dt id="task-status-closed" class="color-red">Closed</dt>
      <dd>Invalid or no longer makes sense</dd>
    </dl>
  </div>
</div>
